      en: "\u{1F3C6} \u2066K9000\u2122\u2069 2.0 - World's Most Advanced Pet Wash Station!\n\n\u2705 TWIN design - 2 wash bays, serves 2 pets simultaneously\n\u2705 4 pumps per side: organic shampoo, conditioner, flea rinse, disinfectant\n\u2705 100% Australian Tea Tree Oil - repels pests, antibacterial\n\u2705 Dual-speed warm air dryers\n\u2705 Always warm water - 27-amp 3-phase\n\u2705 Contactless payment: NFC, QR, credit card, Apple Pay\n\u2705 7-star luxury LED lighting\n\u2705 Available 24/7, rain or shine\n\u2705 Fits all breeds - Chihuahua to Great Dane \u{1F43E}",
